{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_012Riy1fNfJ3Yif7bH8f7hLs","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t## Area 7 — scalarmult / sign / box / kx / kdf / kem\n2\t\n3\tFiles covered: as listed in `errors_7.md` (same file set, read in full).\n4\t\n5\t### Configuration axes extracted from the source\n6\t\n7\t| axis | values |\n8\t|------|--------|\n9\t| curve25519 scalarmult entry point | `crypto_scalarmult` / `crypto_scalarmult_curve25519` (full, 2-arg point) vs `crypto_scalarmult_base` / `crypto_scalarmult_curve25519_base` |\n10\t| curve25519 scalar shape | arbitrary 32 bytes (always clamped: `t[0] &= 248; t[31] &= 127; t[31] |= 64`), all-zero, all-`0xff`, `L`, pre-clamped |\n11\t| curve25519 point shape | basepoint `09 00 … 00`, random valid point, non-canonical-but-not-blocklisted (`>= p`), blocklisted small-order (7 encodings) |\n12\t| ed25519 scalarmult variant | `crypto_scalarmult_ed25519` (clamped, point) / `_noclamp` (point) / `_base` (clamped) / `_base_noclamp` |\n13\t| ristretto255 scalarmult variant | `crypto_scalarmult_ristretto255` (point) / `_base`; never clamped, only `t[31] &= 127` |\n14\t| sign API shape | attached one-shot (`crypto_sign` / `_open`) vs detached one-shot (`crypto_sign_detached` / `_verify_detached`) vs multipart prehashed (`crypto_sign_init` / `_update` / `_final_create` / `_final_verify`) |\n15\t| sign namespace | generic `crypto_sign_*` vs explicit `crypto_sign_ed25519*` / `crypto_sign_ed25519ph_*` (the generic ones are pure aliases) |\n16\t| multipart chunking | 0 / 1 / 2 / many `_update` calls; chunk boundaries at 0, 1, 63, 64, 65, 127, 128, 129 bytes |\n17\t| keypair source | `_seed_keypair(seed)` (deterministic) vs `_keypair()` (`randombytes_buf`) |\n18\t| key conversions | `crypto_sign_ed25519_sk_to_seed`, `_sk_to_pk`, `_pk_to_curve25519`, `_sk_to_curve25519` |\n19\t| message length | 0, 1, 31, 32, 33, 63, 64, 65, 127, 128, 129, 255, 256, 257, 1024, 8192 (spans SHA-512 block boundaries at 128 and the 112-byte padding cliff) |\n20\t| `siglen_p` / `smlen_p` / `mlen_p` / `m` | NULL vs non-NULL (each is explicitly NULL-checked) |\n21\t| box AEAD primitive | `curve25519xsalsa20poly1305` (default, generic `crypto_box_*`) vs `curve25519xchacha20poly1305` |\n22\t| box API shape | `_easy` / `_open_easy`; `_detached` / `_open_detached`; `_beforenm` + `_easy_afternm` / `_open_easy_afternm` / `_detached_afternm` / `_open_detached_afternm`; NaCl padded `crypto_box` / `_open` / `_afternm` / `_open_afternm` (xsalsa only); `_seal` / `_seal_open` |\n23\t| kx role | `crypto_kx_client_session_keys` vs `crypto_kx_server_session_keys` (loop order is swapped) |\n24\t| kx output pointers | both non-NULL, `rx == NULL`, `tx == NULL` |\n25\t| kdf primitive | blake2b (`crypto_kdf_*`) vs hkdf-sha256 vs hkdf-sha512 |\n26\t| kdf blake2b axes | `subkey_len` ∈ {16 (MIN), 17, 31, 32, 33, 63, 64 (MAX)}; `subkey_id` ∈ {0, 1, 2, 2^32-1, 2^32, 2^63, 2^64-1}; 8-byte `ctx` |\n27\t| hkdf axes | `extract` one-shot vs `extract_init` + N × `extract_update` + `extract_final`; `salt_len` ∈ {0, 1, 32, 64, 128, 129}; `ikm_len` ∈ {0, 1, 32, 64, 1000}; `out_len` ∈ {0 (MIN), 1, 31, 32, 33, 63, 64, 65, 8160 / 16320 (MAX)}; `ctx_len` ∈ {0, 1, 8, 64} |\n28\t| kem primitive | `mlkem768` vs `xwing` vs generic `crypto_kem_*` (→ xwing) |\n29\t| kem API shape | `_keypair` / `_seed_keypair`; `_enc` (randomised) / `_enc_deterministic`; `_dec` |\n30\t| dispatch | `_crypto_scalarmult_curve25519_pick_best_implementation` — only one value on this build (ref10); sandy2x not selected |\n31\t\n32\t### CONFIGURATION-SURFACE table\n33\t\n34\t| # | entry point(s) | configuration (options set + input shape) | [ ] |\n35\t|---|----------------|--------------------------------------------|-----|\n36\t| 7.1 | `crypto_scalarmult_curve25519_base`, `crypto_scalarmult_base` | RFC 7748 vector: `n = a5 46 e3 6b f0 52 7c 9d 3b 16 15 4b 82 46 5e dd 62 14 4c 0a c1 fc 5a 18 50 6a 22 44 ba 44 9a c4` → `q = 8520f0098930a754748b7ddcb43ef75a0d