gents are\n  editing other modules concurrently — touch only what you must, never reformat).\n\nFinish with `timeout 600 cargo test --offline --test a7_kem` at 0 failures. Then tick ONLY the\ncrypto_kem rows of `configs_7.md` `[ ]` → `[x]`, and append a status value (`verified` /\n`unreachable-from-public-API` / `undefined-behaviour-not-tested` / `not-exported`) to ONLY the\ncrypto_kem rows of `errors_7.md`. If the ` | status |` header column is not present yet, add it\nand widen the separator row (match `$ROOT/translation/phaseA/errors_1.md`); leave other rows'\nstatus cells empty for the other agents.\nReport: test count, rows checked off, divergences found+fixed, gaps+reasons.","uuid":"eb9a0dd9-a9cc-409b-9202-200a9c1ef54b","session_id":"b566403e-4c11-4a9b-ad3a-d43b1f08afd2"}
