{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_011E61uxhWtAQuBpTMKXbpXv","type":"tool_result","content":"   Compiling sodium v1.0.23 (/local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-RqaJY6/translation)\n    Finished `test` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 0.26s\n     Running tests/a2_gaps.rs (target/debug/deps/a2_gaps-5967890819c7e750)\n\nrunning 8 tests\ntest zz_debug_trace ... ok\ntest mont_to_ed_cmov_path_at_zero ... ok\ntest ristretto255_p3_tobytes_both_rotate_arms ... ok\ntest ristretto255_elligator_both_square_arms ... ok\ntest fp_replica_matches_library ... ok\ntest ristretto255_frombytes_every_rejection_arm ... ok\ntest from_hash_reduce64_and_notsquare_arms ... ok\ntest elligator2_both_notsquare_arms ... ok\n\ntest result: ok. 8 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 1.01s","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01Y8KmEUWZuyfELGp9tb2pNF","session_id":"b566403e-4c11-4a9b-ad3a-d43b1f08afd2","uuid":"0ffffe45-5876-447f-8616-3421edb36edb","timestamp":"2026-08-31T04:23:23.968Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Finish area 2 bookkeeping+gaps"}
